summary:
- Previously announced Southwest service to Bellingham, Wash. to begin Nov. 7, 2021;

- New destination: Syracuse, New York service begins on Nov. 14, 2021;

- New international service from both Chicago (O'Hare) and Kansas City to Cancun will complement the full re-opening of all previously served international destinations.

